The mail client at web/ is a reimplementation of Mailflare's mail client. Copied
and adapted paths:

- web/src/app/(dashboard)     mail client route group (inbox, sent, drafts, spam, trash, starred, snoozed, archived, scheduled, folders, compose)
- web/src/app/(settings)      client settings pages
- web/src/components/**       messages, compose, ui, contacts, mail-search, shortcuts, sidebar and shell components
- web/src/hooks/**            client data hooks
- web/src/lib/**              email parsing/formatting, i18n, time, folders, mailboxes, mail-api and search helpers
- web/public/locales/id.json  Indonesian translations

Mailflare's Cloudflare Workers backend (D1/drizzle schema, Worker entrypoints and
Turnstile auth) was not carried over. The client talks to this repository's Rust
HTTP API instead, and the upstream chrome (admin, domains, calendar, drive,
booking, AI assistant, MCP, licenses) was dropped.

